  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Reactivity of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;substitution<math><mo>&#8733;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math> can be&nbsp;present on the aromatic compound.<br />Electrophilic substitution <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8733;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8733;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8733;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0320_415117e8105e.png\" style=\"width: 417px; height: 237px;\" /><br />(order of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> density <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></math> electrophilic substitution)<br />Ring <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> density is highest.<br />So <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>"
  }
